            "description": "**Not functional against this local stack.** This is the real endpoint that starts bff-mobile's login: it captures `deviceId` from this query param, then redirects (302) to the identity provider's authorization endpoint (PKCE-enabled). In this repo, that provider only exists as a JUnit/WireMock test fixture (see the root README's identity note) -- it is not running as part of `docker compose up`, so this redirect has nowhere valid to land and the flow cannot complete from Postman. Included here purely as a documented reference for what the real login entry point looks like; the rest of this folder uses a locally-minted dev JWT instead (see the folder description)."
          }
        },
