            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/login/oauth2/code/oidc",
            "description": "**Not functional against this local stack.** This is the real callback the identity provider redirects back to after a successful login; bff-mobile handles it internally, mints the device-bound session JWT, registers the device with core-service, and returns `{sessionToken, refreshToken, refreshTokenExpiry}` directly as JSON (no cookie, unlike bff-web). Calling it directly with no valid authorization code/state from a real provider will fail. Included purely as a documented reference -- see docs/contracts/bff-mobile/openapi.yaml for the full contract."
